{"3899420": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Tester Wanted", "steam_appid": 3899420, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899420/extras/16f26844c3c4de5c19395146c2b5e02c.avif?t=1770843893\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>HOW'D YOU LIKE TO BECOME A VIDEO GAME TESTER?</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help a developer test out several game prototypes he's thrown together in his quest to discover the ultimate formula for creating the perfect video game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > He’ll guide you, watch your every move, and provide insightful comments throughout your journey and tests. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899420/extras/54b1b883581e915a3372237cbe9581c4.webp?t=1770843893\" width=97 height=16 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>These levels will put to the test</u></strong><u>:</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your patience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your willpower</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your logic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your deduction skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your calm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your perseverance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your patience twice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your emotions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your improvisation</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While his work borders on perfection <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899420/extras/327512a1e3e97d56212bc9c4b517d553.webp?t=1770843893\" width=70 height=18 /></span>, you might very occasionally run into some minor bugs. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899420/extras/ebdab390362bd0e3a56f357fe0784b55.webp?t=1770843893\" width=507 height=15 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll explore a wide variety of game genres, puzzles, shooters, collectathons, renovation sims, horror, suspense, walking simulators, RPGs… and more.<br>All these levels are based on 100% original ideas, carefully crafted specifically for his<i> </i>work. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899420/extras/d32d97f65075accca05642657f121f25.webp?t=1770843893\" width=125 height=16 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No one’s expecting perfection from you, mistakes are human, and we’re all human! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899420/extras/aaeac5671742738be88bc5ba76e82033.webp?t=1770843893\" width=259 height=18 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See you soon! I can’t wait to see how you’ll handle it all and help me reach my goals!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899420/extras/15937544683e1daf616514130266b74b.webp?t=1770843893\" width=374 height=15 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>About the creation of Tester Wanted</u> :</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🇨🇵 Cocorico this game was developed by a fully French team and, since the team is just me, that was pretty quick to confirm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I’m pointing it out because French games are trendy right now, would be a shame not to ride the wave!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899420/extras/16f26844c3c4de5c19395146c2b5e02c.avif?t=1770843893\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>HOW'D YOU LIKE TO BECOME A VIDEO GAME TESTER?</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help a developer test out several game prototypes he's thrown together in his quest to discover the ultimate formula for creating the perfect video game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > He’ll guide you, watch your every move, and provide insightful comments throughout your journey and tests. <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899420/extras/54b1b883581e915a3372237cbe9581c4.webp?t=1770843893\" width=97 height=16 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>These levels will put to the test</u></strong><u>:</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your patience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your willpower</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your logic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your deduction skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your calm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your perseverance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your patience twice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your emotions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your improvisation</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While his work borders on perfection <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3899420/extras/327512a1e3e97d56212bc9c4b517d553.webp